{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_06_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_06","title":"领主宅邸攻防战","storyCode":"OD-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"573685bd8dada05bb2fefb845100e41d2c4bd1bb03a76b17df471c9917f24ef0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"长泉镇领主的长子策划篡权，命令雇佣兵与变异生物对领主发动袭击。领主卫队在袭击中全军覆没，罗德岛联合彩虹小队与叛军交战。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nobleN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"已净空！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，警戒交给你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大，看看躺在地上的雇佣兵还有没有人活着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"马上就办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂娜，把绷带拿来。我们清点人数，给伤员包扎一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"别装死！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，把......把铳口移开！我什么都说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹，把他绑起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生呢？米亚罗医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂娜！绷带！快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"保持清醒！小伙子，不要闭上眼睛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强行使用源石技艺......源石感染扩散了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛没有办法吗？你们不是最擅长这个吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失血、灼伤、矿石病剧烈发作，就算是在罗德岛本舰......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"撑住，小伙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......坚持住，你不是还想远游他乡吗？想想你梦中的哥伦比亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......坚持住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"......他走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我没能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不是你的错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......这和我没关系，我不是负责的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"*俄语粗口*，今天你别想活着出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是......别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"你完了，*俄语粗口*，你死定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"别！别打我！不是我干的！别！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大！别这样！冷静点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个卫兵队长去哪儿了？就那位领主之女？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"她追着逃走的人跑出去了，巡林者跟着她一起过去了，别担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......医生身上的结晶......在发光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么快？为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别管这个了！找个房间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及解释了！动作快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找布料来！窗帘、床单，什么都可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"把医生抬到那边的小屋子里！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生怎么了？为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科，科恩小姐，请您冷静一下，芙兰卡已经在处理医生的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"处理什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们没有见过吗？我可能要之后再来解释——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"堵住门窗！不要留出缝隙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"烟囱！把烟囱也堵住！还有通风口！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......这是在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚？医生的尸体......出什么问题了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"别去看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"别去看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"上面堵死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"门窗堵死了！没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，屋子里亮起来了？窗户在发光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科恩小姐！别靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"到底发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生他......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["霜华"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]}]}
